  "@id": "https://pices-data.github.io/odis/records/zenodo-23505387.jsonld",
  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "FOCI/SEBSCC Pribilof Island Acoustic Survey",
  "description": "These data include acoustic backscatter at 38 and 120 kHz, CTD, surface temperature, salinity and fluorescence and bird counts along 4 transects near the Pribilof Islands surveyed in September 1994-1998. Also included were occasional corroboratory Method and Anchovy trawl and MOCNESS casts.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: This data set was collected to examine the relationship between the distribution of juvenile Pollock and environmental factors and plankton. By examining this relationship over multiple years and transects (day and night) we hope to better understand the source of Pollock year class strength in this Pollock nursery area.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23505388",
